kind":"announcement","title":"\"Curse Of The Abandoned Floor\" Steam Wishlists officially surpass 10,000!","summary":"Hello everyone, During the Steam Next Fest, we were thrilled to hit a major milestone for \"Curse Of The Abandoned Floor\"—our Steam Wishlist count has officially crossed 10,000! For our indie development team, \"10,000\" is much more than just a number; it represents the recognition, trust, and expectations of every single player. From our initial concept to the continuous polishing and updates of the demo, every playtest, piece of feedback, and wishlist addition has been the driving force keeping ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:05:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043495","verified_at":"2026-10-26T12:53:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4568330-1846651706692998","game_id":"steam-4568330","kind":"announcement","title":"Curse Of The Abandoned Floor is joining Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello everyone! Starting October 19, the Curse Of The Abandoned Floor demo will officially be part of Steam Next Fest.Since we first launched the demo, we’ve received a lot of valuable feedback and have rolled out several updates to fine-tune level pacing, balance difficulty, and fix various issues affecting the player experience.Whether you are stepping in for the first time or have already explored those forsaken floors before, we invite you to update or download the demo during Next Fest to e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:55:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692998","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4568330-1840310314348922","game_id":"steam-4568330","kind":"announcement","title":"Curse Of The Abandoned Floor Has Reached 5,000 Wishlists!","summary":"It has been two weeks since the Demo launched. Thank you so much for all your support!During this time, we have received a great deal of feedback and encouragement from players. Your voices have helped us continue improving the game.Today, we are very happy to announce:🎉 Curse Of The Abandoned Floor has now surpassed 5,000 wishlists on Steam!Thank you to everyone who added the game to their wishlist, played the Demo, and shared their feedback with us.Development of the full version is progressin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T08:22:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348922","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4568330-1839676055890027","game_id":"steam-4568330","kind":"update","title":"Demo Bug Fix Update","summary":"Thank you for playing the Curse Of The Abandoned Floor Demo and for reporting the issues you encountered.This update addresses the following issues:Added a Camera Smoothing Toggle Camera smoothing can now be enabled or disabled under “Options → Gameplay → Camera Move Smooth.”Fixed Issues That Could Prevent Progression Fixed several situations where the game could become stuck and prevent players from progressing.Fixed Several AI Logic Issues Fixed several issues that could cause the AI to behave","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T05:11:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890027","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4568330-1839676055881334","game_id":"steam-4568330","kind":"update","title":"Curse Of The Abandoned Floor Demo — Bug Fixes and Optimization Update","summary":"Since the release of the Curse Of The Abandoned Floor Demo, we have been overwhelmed by the enthusiasm and support from the community. We would like to sincerely thank everyone who has downloaded and played the Demo, as well as those who have taken the time to share their feedback with us!We have carefully reviewed the issues reported by players and have been working urgently on bug fixes and improvements to the overall experience. The following changes have been implemented in the latest versio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T02:01:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4568330-1839041357033921","game_id":"steam-4568330","kind":"announcement","title":"The Free Demo of Curse Of The Abandoned Floor Is Coming Soon!","summary":"Hello everyone! We are Lakecho Studio, the development team behind Curse Of The Abandoned Floor. We are excited to announce that the free Demo of our first-person psychological horror game, Curse Of The Abandoned Floor, will launch on Steam on July 27, 2026, at 3:00 PM Beijing Time (UTC+8). This is our studio’s first game and a horror experience into which we have poured a great deal of time, effort, and passion. In the Demo, players will step into a forgotten elevator floor, explore its abandon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T15:12:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033921","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:11:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4568330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:53:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:53:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam